                    "level": {
                      "value": 1
                    },
                    "description": {
                      "value": "You attempt to reduce panic. Attempt a Diplomacy check, comparing it to the Will DC of creatures in a 10-foot emanation around you who are frightened. Each of them is temporarily immune for 1 hour.\n\n- **Critical Success:** Reduce the creature's frightened value by 2.\n- **Success:** Reduce the creature's frightened value by 1."
